  "releaseNotes": "Add the renderer-neutral engine of the new document controls (grid model, spreadsheet and word-processing engines, documents and PDF, XLSX, DOCX and CSV writers), so a server can build and write documents without WPF. Add the contracts and models for Business Module Manager positions, contact attachments, attendance setup and product setup.\n\nFull release note: https://github.com/MatrixCode-ID/em-system/blob/v0.1.0-alpha.21/doc/ReleaseNote/EmSys.Libs/0.1.0-alpha.21.md",
